_48.png","text":"```\n['foo', 'bar']\n['foo']\n```","mrkdwn_in":["text"],"blocks":null,"footer":"Posted in #lang-vim-script","ts":1635822923.028800,"from_url":"https://vim-jp.slack.com/archives/CUPKWMQFK/p1635822923028800","original_url":"https://vim-jp.slack.com/archives/CUPKWMQFK/p1635822923028800"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"cScCP"}]},{"client_msg_id":"85d1855c-180b-4ce6-aa7e-5cced886185f","type":"message","user":"U01AQ5BFNLX","text":"getcompletionの前にfeedkyesをcallしてるんですが…","ts":"1635822928.015800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"aPv"}]},{"client_msg_id":"324af71d-d41d-4ad3-a791-02bb46dad837","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"ちゃんと使えばちゃんと結果は出るはず、使い方がおかしい","ts":"1635822843.015300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"wdBcT"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6afd73b5-8d93-487c-a0b7-a268216e925e","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"sonictemplateの話","ts":"1635822822.014700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"67sM"}]},{"client_msg_id":"46fa4dfb-df09-4b84-8875-1e90bc35b0d1","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"C-dの結果を得たいならC-dされたときのコマンドラインを渡す必要がありますよ","ts":"1635822821.014600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"2xLn"}]},{"client_msg_id":"17384ba9-c33e-40be-80ac-4298921d916f","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"あれ、 `getcompletion('Template f', 'cmdline')` したらちゃんとフィルタリングされてる気が","ts":"1635822812.014100","thread_ts":"1635822812.014100","reply_count":2,"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"YoRrp"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0017979b-facd-4989-be37-eda21879c330","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"コマンドラインがからだからです","ts":"1635822792.012900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"sszgk"}]},{"client_msg_id":"58f65f03-acd1-49d9-8cb6-357c64acdefd","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"コマンド一覧がでるのは","ts":"1635822780.012400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"w5Y5"}]},{"type":"message","user":"UPZHKAM7W","text":"```\ngetcompletion({pat}, {type} [, {filtered}])             *getcompletion()*\n                コマンドライン補完のマッチするリストを返す。{type}は何のための\n                ものかを指定する。次の補完タイプがサポートされている:\n \n                arglist         引数リスト内のファイル名\n                augroup         自動コマンドグループ\n                buffer          バッファ名\n                behave          |:behave|サブオプション\n                color           カラースキーム\n                command         Exコマンド (および引数)\n                cmdline         |cmdline-completion| の結果\n                compiler        コンパイラ\n                cscope          |:cscope|のサブオプション\n                diff_buffer     |:diffget| と |:diffput| の補完\n                dir             ディレクトリ名\n                environment     環境変数名\n                event           自動コマンドのイベント\n                expression      Vim式\n                file            ファイルおよびディレクトリ名\n                file_in_path    |'path'|のファイルおよびディレクトリ名\n                filetype        ファイルタイプ名 |'filetype'|\n                function        関数名\n                help            ヘルプ項目\n                highlight       ハイライトグループ\n                history         |:history|サブオプション\n                locale          ロケール名 (locale -aの出力)\n                mapclear        バッファ引数\n                mapping         マッピング名\n                menu            メニュー\n                messages        |:messages|サブオプション\n                option          オプション\n                packadd         任意パッケージ |pack-add| 名\n                shellcmd        シェルコマンド\n                sign            |:sign|サブオプション\n                syntax          構文ファイル名 |'syntax'|\n                syntime         |:syntime|サブオプション\n                tag             タグ\n                tag_listfiles   タグ、ファイル名\n                user            ユーザー名\n                var             ユーザー変数\n \n                {pat}が空文字列の場合、すべてのマッチが返される。それ以外の場\n                合、{pat}と一致する項目のみが返される。{pat}での特殊文字の使用\n                については、|wildcards|を参照。\n \n                オプションの{filtered}フラグが1に設定されている場合、結果をフィ\n                ルタリングするために 'wildignore'が適用される。そうでなければ、\n                すべての一致が返される。'wildignorecase'オプションは常に適用さ\n                れる。\n \n                {type}が \"cmdline\" ならば |cmdline-completion| の結果が返され\n                る。\n                例えば、\":call\" コマンドの後で補完できる値は:  \n                        echo getcompletion('call ', 'cmdline')\n \n                一致するものがなければ、空のリストが返される。{type}の値が無効\n                だと、エラーが発生する。\n \n                |method| としても使用できる:  \n                        GetPattern()-\u0026gt;getcompletion('color')\n```","ts":"1635822623.012000","bot_id":"BPM858KEE","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":null},{"client_msg_id":"d2fb0a67-77a8-4ee6-b5bb-0445d5f78bd0","type":"message","user":"U01AQ5BFNLX","text":":h getcompletion","ts":"1635822623.011900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"EItUB"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2fecd669-40aa-4a9a-b13b-a0ff0dc90086","type":"message","user":"U01AQ5BFNLX","text":"どうやろうかな","ts":"1635822553.011500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"TlC=1"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7bade7e0-89e4-4c70-9f11-761d3e82073c","type":"message","user":"U01AQ5BFNLX","text":"なるほど","ts":"1635822539.011300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"6vI"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f07d19ff-1b96-4840-b75a-b8173336c06e","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"件のバグは候補自体が全く出ないという物なのでその挙動自体は変わってないはずです","ts":"1635822533.011000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ds3/h"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6efa228c-3693-4b19-b1f2-6508fa3c9c80","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"あー、あくまで候補取ってるだけだからそうなるのか","ts":"1635822512.010500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"K6Ye"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ba367cad-e4e2-44c2-8cb0-b7c0052a2cc5","type":"message","user":"U01AQ5BFNLX","text":"ちょっとあげてみます","ts":"1635822500.010200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"C9h="}]},{"client_msg_id":"d654cc79-c038-4ae0-8f80-65021e374b65","type":"message","user":"U01AQ5BFNLX","text":"headか","ts":"1635822494.010000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"1E/dU"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2734e2d5-20d7-4f55-b995-a4b4168d352d","type":"message","user":"U01AQ5BFNLX","text":"全コマンドが表示される…","ts":"1635822481.009700","edited":{"user":"U01AQ5BFNLX","ts":"1635822489.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ou=v"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c236301c-fb43-473b-9392-577dfcddf528","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"そのケースだとさっき貼ったのでよさそう(ただバグがあって最近直ったのでHEADに上げる必要あり)","ts":"1635822402.009400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"5AfXb"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a2b8778d-e183-4da7-8341-280ca19f729f","type":"message","user":"U01AQ5BFNLX","text":"例えば、sonictemplateみたいな コマンドに引数があるものに対して\n`\u0026lt;C-d\u0026gt;` ででてきた引数候補一覧が欲しいです","ts":"1635822319.008800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"cM40"}]},{"type":"message","user":"UPZHKAM7W","text":"```\ngetcmdline()                                            *getcmdline()*\n                現在のコマンドラインの内容を取得する。コマンドラインを編集して\n                いるときのみ動作する。つまり|c_CTRL-\\_e|または|c_CTRL-R_=|を使っ\n                ているときのみ有効。\n                例:  \n                        :cmap \u0026lt;F7\u0026gt; \u0026lt;C-\\\u0026gt;eescape(getcmdline(), ' \\')\u0026lt;CR\u0026gt;\n                |getcmdtype()|, |getcmdpos()|, |setcmdpos()|も参照。\n                パスワードを入力する時や |inputsecret()| を使う時は空文字列を\n                返す。\n```","ts":"1635822119.007600","bot_id":"BPM858KEE","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":null},{"client_msg_id":"cc484a96-0b79-4898-b647-16f326a3105a","type":"message","user":"U01AQ5BFNLX","text":":h getcmdline","ts":"1635822118.007500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"urcB"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c1dc5dc7-d8c1-436b-9b24-d8c60553ba8e","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"これフルパス取れるから微妙に違うな","ts":"1635821995.007200","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"tashikani","count":1,"users":["U01AQ5BFNLX"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"GYZ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8f821730-7aab-46e7-9271-e4c3c8bf1db1","type":"message","user":"U01AQ5BFNLX","text":"やってみます!","ts":"1635821984.007000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"VM4o"}]},{"client_msg_id":"021a5da0-cbf5-4353-b400-71e85c83bd8d","type":"message","user":"U01AQ5BFNLX","text":"あ、それでいけるんですね","ts":"1635821980.006700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"3ijK"}]},{"client_msg_id":"49b14929-f509-43ab-935b-88771c5860a7","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"`echo getcompletion(getcmdline(), 'cmdline')` とかそういう？","ts":"1635821961.006500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"sFKp"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f7ace975-177f-4f6d-8f87-6404636d4272","type":"message","user":"U01AQ5BFNLX","text":"質問です。 Cmdlineで `C-d`した結果を取得したいのですが、どうしたらできるでしょうか？","ts":"1635821834.006000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"qB4qW"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a39c4db2-a8d8-463c-b452-88ed4847db18","type":"message","user":"UD1FQV38V","text":"トラックボールでマイクラくらいなら出来るくらいになれてしまったからなぁ…","ts":"1635821494.005100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"naRQ+"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2ee7d3e0-593a-4b52-a2c3-f1ae9613a014","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"細かい範囲ならマウスに利があると思ってるけどだいぶトラックボールに慣れてしまったのでもう分からない","ts":"1635821127.004500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"4qlyk"}]},{"client_msg_id":"12527d59-6f1b-48be-ab92-9d20d3427ca9","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"話変わっちゃうんですけど、マウスとトラックボールだとどっちが正確なエイムしやすいんですかねー","ts":"1635821061.004300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"+QR"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0895f1a5-1466-4ce9-b898-6c08fdb4192c","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"surroundはVSCodeVimに組み込まれてるっぽいけど、surroundとsandwichの機能的差分も個人的にはめちゃくちゃあるので","ts":"1635820888.003700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Ufna"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0585b619-bc5b-4f83-9c7f-5df8e1f8db69","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"sandwichはVimの範囲を超えて強すぎる","ts":"1635820819.002900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"IdH"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a68762e5-d73e-44eb-8244-3c915f239861","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"めちゃくちゃわかる","ts":"1635820805.002600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"73yw"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2f8ec804-4d1d-4750-97be-a8860a3ed28d","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"sandwichやsurroundは同程度のことを素のVimでやるのでさえつらい","ts":"1635820784.002400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"iWIJ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"92654A53-2AB8-4AF5-8B71-5427656CFFAE","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"カーソル便利な時もあるけど、そのためだけに手をキーボードから離すのは避けたい気持ちがある","ts":"1635820720.001800","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"wakaru","count":1,"users":["U9S4G0LJW"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"njiQ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6b2685fb-686b-4937-8302-e99d36e7b8aa","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"正確なドラッグ苦手すぎる","ts":"1635820694.001100","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"wakaru","count":1,"users":["U76GA7MFA"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"q9p"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c47bfb65-6fbd-442b-a624-28141fa42ab1","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"diくらいならドラッグさえ正確なら手数的にはそこまで変わらなさそうだけど（まぁ辛いけど）、sd(sandwich)みたいなのがしたいときに対応する機能がなくて手間に感じますね","ts":"1635820628.000900","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"wakaru","count":1,"users":["U9S4G0LJW"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"VYOJ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"de75703c-f3be-4726-8ed2-69a970d543be","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"VSCodeユーザのエイム正確そう","ts":"1635820495.499200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"hRRi"}]},{"client_msg_id":"73d505ef-7cd6-4755-a989-406d0a20dccc","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"両方同じ時間使った前提なら、Vimの方がそれでも早いだろうけどそんなにはってなりそうです","ts":"1635820472.498800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"9qi"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9e37e531-9e61-4298-96e9-94742435872a","type":"message","user":"UL6CFN8NR","text":"マウス操作って視覚からのフィードバックが必須なので、繰り返すたびにちょびっとずつ神経を削っていくんですよねー\n特にテキストエディタに関係する操作だと「あーこのカッコの中身だけ消したいのに右括弧だけ間違えて消しちゃった」とかよくやってしまう。\nそういうときに Vim だと `di)` と3手打つだけでよくなるので、手以外の疲れが発生しない","ts":"1635820466.498500","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"sorena","count":1,"users":["U9S4G0LJW"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"YBnj"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d5e58e5f-ef56-47f5-bbd1-effa0f56819e","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"時間的な差が大きいとしたらVSCodeの習熟度的に機能を使いこなせないのが原因になりそう","ts":"1635820434.497500","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"vim","count":1,"users":["U025UTETFDJ"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"xAb"}]},{"client_msg_id":"92cd0c0b-7239-4a10-9789-e165268661cd","type":"message","user":"U02GD5GRJ72","text":"長い間、マウスを触らないのでいつの間にかマウスが待機モードになって、再接続までに時間をとられるというのが多々あります。（無線）","ts":"1635820429.497300","edited":{"user":"U02GD5GRJ72","ts":"1635820468.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Sj6"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6ad04087-70b4-45d9-a0b3-1b95319cc11c","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"案外マウス操作でもそれなりに速かったりするんですよね、細かいストレスが溜まって精神エネルギーが削られていくけど","ts":"1635820355.494000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"kafR"}]},{"client_msg_id":"51bd412e-c800-4773-9dc6-2c3a722ddea4","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"Vimならdot repeatやマクロの数打鍵で済む作業をマウス操作毎回挟むみたいな","ts":"1635820354.493900","edited":{"user":"U8996GYBF","ts":"1635820359.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"/ZY"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1bc489f4-c038-4de8-bc1c-a55169aa02c8","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"vimperator時代から思ってるんですけど、体感作業効率が圧倒的に大きいと思うんですよね","ts":"1635820307.492900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Dz1"}]},{"client_msg_id":"68c9d7d0-aeaf-4006-9c01-ec3f7e87f6da","type":"message","user":"UL6CFN8NR","text":"私も時間ベースで計ったら、効率はそこまで大きくは落ちない気がします。\nどちらかというと、脳が割かなければならないリソースの相対量や（単調作業に対する）精神的なストレスとかのほうが大きくなりそう。","ts":"1635820235.492100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"KeY"}]},{"client_msg_id":"35e71e09-53a6-4c96-bc4d-ee9bb2b4dc3e","type":"message","user":"U02BDFBM620","text":"作業の種類にもよるけれど，ぶっちゃけ僕の場合はあまり効率が落ちないですね．Vimはいじるのが楽しいから使っているのであって，効率よいからというのは，ちょっと違うと思っています．ただ，矩形選択ができると何かと便利なので，効率が落ちているとしたらそのくらいですね．","ts":"1635818280.490600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"A7zSV"}]},{"client_msg_id":"701c290f-a014-4de6-bf9c-84f57bbd8c09","type":"message","user":"UKHUVMBJR","text":":ese: なのでVSCodeVimの悪さをあまり実感してない…","ts":"1635817003.487800","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"me-too","count":1,"users":["U017BU3UZBQ"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Qf4WQ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"cc2f79e1-a2ae-49e2-94ea-763bcb863ec7","type":"message","user":"UD1FQV38V","text":"「えっそこでVSCodeの機能出てくるの!?」みたいなことが頻繁に起きるのでアレすぎる…","ts":"1635816952.487400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"OjVZd"}]},{"client_msg_id":"bbb8dcbd-a436-4b6b-9448-0028e08a4c7f","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"素のVSCodeのほうが、Vimキーバインドの入ったVSCodeよりも使いやすいよ。半端なエミュレーションは害悪ですらある。","ts":"1635816873.485700","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"wakaru","count":4,"users":["UD1FQV38V","U01D44KSY9Z","U78A6ESHM","U81LLJ340"]},{"name":"sorena","count":5,"users":["U9S4G0LJW","U01E02RM4EM","U7JL1UKKL","U81LLJ340","U02AJP5L75Z"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Omm"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f5f914ba-f1fa-4567-9cea-398b8c347387","type":